    "modifications": "2 real Longview Washington Way, Hudson Street, 20th Avenue and 30th Avenue paths stitched through the OSM graph, heading Gaussian-smoothed, positions re-integrated from heading, then pinned back onto the real junctions (largest drift closed 18.3 m, spread back along each line), resampled at 2 m with curvature from the sampled positions; land elevation from 3DEP low-pass filtered, bridge decks synthesized (3DEP is bare earth); lanes simplified to the configured cross-section; junction connector roads synthesized (a turn, a straight and a turn)"
