  "meta": {
    "status": "live",
    "notes": "A separate civic-street course: southwest on Washington Way, choose its diagonal or the longer Hudson Street and 20th Avenue grid detour, rejoin Washington, cross its mapped bridge and turn north on 30th Avenue. Only the two-way portion of Washington is selected; eastern one-way streets are outside this course. OSM reference fetched 2026-10-15. Road widths, shoulder margins, corner easing, junction movements and bridge protection are arcade adaptations, not surveyed lanes, turn restrictions or current access advice. Town dressing is generic regional scenery, not mapped properties or landmarks. No lake trail, repeated lap, claimed shortcut advantage or Port Shift replacement."
